    "text": "A Chinese journalist teams up with her Brazilian counterpart for a burnout-free adventure in Tianjin. From the folk vibes of Pingju Opera, crosstalk and shadow puppetry, to the high-tech magic of holograms and AI, and finally, the stunning night views of the glittering Haihe River from over 300m height—three unique charms combine to showcase a dynamic Tianjin where tradition and modernity coexist in harmony.",
